        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTwo bedroom apartment available to rent in this excellent Dublin 7 location.\n\nLarge two bedroom first floor apartment to let in a great city centre location.\nEast Arran Street in a modern apartment block consisting of 12 apartments and was built by Cedar Construction.\n\nThis two bedroom apartment consists of 2 double beds, 2 bathrooms, storage/utility room, kitchen. Living & dining area combined, balcony.\n\nEast Arran Street is finished to a high standard and has high quality wooden floors fitted throughout.\n\nThis property is superbly located and is less than 10 minutes walk from O'Connell St. You have a host of local shops, restaurant and cafes on your doorstep. East Arran Street has great transport links with a number of bus stops and the Luas nearby.\n\nPlease note the internal photos may not be of the actual apartment available but are representative of the standard of finish."
